        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ishare is the definitive screen capture utility for macOS, designed with simplicity and efficiency in mind.\n\nCAPTURE ANYTHING\n• Capture a region with a precise selector, a pixel magnifier with coordinates and colors, and a measuring tool\n• Capture any window with or without its shadow, or a whole display, and recapture your last region with one shortcut\n• Scrolling capture stitches long pages and documents into one image\n• Add a gradient background with padding, rounded corners and a shadow to window captures\n• Blur chosen apps and hide the menu bar automatically for privacy\n• Copy text from anywhere on screen with on-device text recognition, and links from QR codes\n• Self-timer, interval capture and per-app capture profiles\n• Everything runs on ScreenCaptureKit, fast and private\n\nRECORD\n• Record a display, a window or a region you draw\n• Show clicks, keystrokes and a webcam bubble in your recordings\n• Capture system audio and your microphone with live level meters\n• Trim recordings before saving, add chapter markers, and export to MP4, MOV, GIF or audio\n• Generate captions on-device, as an .srt file or burned into the video\n• Choose resolution, frame rate, HEVC, HDR and automatic compression before upload\n\nANNOTATE\n• Arrows in several styles, lines, shapes, highlights, pen, marker and text\n• Numbered steps, emoji and symbol stamps, spotlight, blur and pixelate\n• Crop with handles and aspect presets, zoom and pan, a layers sidebar and reusable templates\n• Press Done and your after-capture actions run: copy, save, share and upload\n\nUPLOAD ANYWHERE\n• Imgur out of the box\n• Custom uploaders for chibisafe, Zipline, copyparty, Discord webhooks and your own server, plus ShareX .sxcu import\n• Any S3-compatible storage, with optional expiring links and secrets kept in the Keychain\n• Upload to several destinations at once or pick one per capture\n• Upload text snippets, watch a folder for new files, and retry failed uploads automatically\n• Upload presets with their own shortcuts, a URL shortener and automatic redaction of sensitive text\n• On Macs with Apple Intelligence, an assistant builds uploaders from a conversation\n\nSTAY ORGANIZED\n• A compact, customizable menu with a command palette, recent uploads and previews\n• A Recent Uploads widget and a Capture control in Control Center\n• Drop files on the menu bar icon or use \"Upload with ishare\" in Finder\n• Searchable upload history with filters and server-side deletion\n• Global keyboard shortcuts, Shortcuts actions and a share extension\n• Back up and restore all settings and uploaders in one file\n\nA Liquid Glass design on macOS 26, sound options, a welcome guide and translations into 11 languages round it all off."
          }
